Usage: agent-deck worktree <command> [options]

Manage git worktrees and their session associations.

Commands:
  list              List all worktrees in current repository
  info <session>    Show worktree info for a session
  finish <session>  Merge branch, remove worktree, and delete session
  cleanup [--force] Find and remove orphaned worktrees/sessions
  trust-scripts <repo-path>  Approve .agent-deck/worktree-*.sh for this repo

Global Options:
  -p, --profile <name>   Use specific profile
  --json                 Output as JSON

Examples:
  agent-deck worktree list
  agent-deck worktree list --json
  agent-deck worktree info "My Session"
  agent-deck worktree finish "My Session"
  agent-deck worktree finish "My Session" --no-merge
  agent-deck worktree finish "My Session" --into develop
  agent-deck worktree cleanup
  agent-deck worktree cleanup --force
  agent-deck worktree trust-scripts .
  agent-deck worktree trust-scripts . --revoke
